{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Artillery Tycoon puts you in charge of building and managing a growing artillery factory. Research advanced weapon designs, optimize production, and fulfill contracts for nations in need of heavy firepower. Test your creations on the shooting range to ensure peak performance and outclass the competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your success hinges on balancing resources, innovation, and market strategy. Experiment with unique artillery designs, expand your operations, and establish your reputation as a leader in military manufacturing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you dominate the global market and reshape the future of warfare? Step into the world of Artillery Tycoon\u00a0and\u00a0find\u00a0out!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3370510?t=1738291752","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370510/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1738291752","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370510/720cf3738c0cb42f2ecd8aa9a7643400f1186a3f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1738291752","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370510/720cf3738c0cb42f2ecd8aa9a7643400f1186a3f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1738291752","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>January update!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I have great news!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Production have started of the game and we expect it to be able to be released before the summer of 2025! I will try to let you all know what we are working on every two weeks to keep you updated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're interested please go in and add the game to your Wishlist and visit us on our discord channel where we can answer questions.</p></p><br><h1>Second uodate!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I'm happy to let you guys know we are continuing to develop the game and in the last couple of weeks I have been working on mostly programming the different functions of the game but I have also updated the main screen and the factory screen to improve the feel for the game play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you haven't already please go and Wishlist the game. I'm a small game developer so wish listing\u00a0the game will show me your support! Thank you!<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370510/extras/main_screen.jpg?t=1738291752\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370510/extras/updated_factory.jpg?t=1738291752\" /> </p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Artillery Tycoon puts you in charge of building and managing a growing artillery factory. Research advanced weapon designs, optimize production, and fulfill contracts for nations in need of heavy firepower. Test your creations on the shooting range to ensure peak performance and outclass the competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your success hinges on balancing resources, innovation, and market strategy. Experiment with unique artillery designs, expand your operations, and establish your reputation as a leader in military manufacturing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you dominate the global market and reshape the future of warfare? Step into the world of Artillery Tycoon\u00a0and\u00a0find\u00a0out!</p>","developers":["Awful Waffle Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370510/header.jpg?t=1738291752","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257076238,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2570762